{"seq":2,"slug":"connectivity","title":"连接性设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-peering-transit","title":"VPC 对等与 Transit Gateway","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/vpc-peering-transit","wordCount":1564,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"private-link-endpoints","title":"PrivateLink 与服务端点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/private-link-endpoints","wordCount":1570,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"hybrid-cloud-vpn-directconnect","title":"混合云 VPN 与专线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/hybrid-cloud-vpn-directconnect","wordCount":1537,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"连接性设计\">连接性设计</h1><p>当工作负载分布在多个 VPC、多个账户甚至混合环境中时，如何建立高效、安全、可管理的连接通道成为网络架构的核心挑战。本章覆盖三种递进的连接模式：VPC 之间的对等与中转网关、通过 PrivateLink 暴露和消费服务端点、以及通过 VPN 和专线打通本地数据中心与云的混合链路。</p>\n<p>三篇文档在覆盖面上形成互补：Peering 和 Transit Gateway 解决的是 VPC 间&quot;网络层可达&quot;的问题；PrivateLink 解决的是&quot;应用层按服务暴露&quot;的问题；VPN 与专线则把连接边界从云内扩展到云外。理解三者各自的适用边界，是构建企业级多账户网络架构的关键。</p>\n"}